WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.020
We're also here — one of the biggest shopping cart manufacturers in Brazil today.

00:03.020 --> 00:07.120
We could talk about the big brands we've worked with, like Caçol, among others,

00:07.120 --> 00:09.440
and I'll ask him to share a bit of the brand's story today.

00:09.440 --> 00:10.760
How do we talk about the brand? Let's go.

00:10.760 --> 00:17.520
I'll put it all out there — people are watching us. KS Metais, a company from the interior of Santa Catarina,

00:17.520 --> 00:22.700
started with renovations and carts, then we began manufacturing carts,

00:22.700 --> 00:28.080
always focused on innovation, new products — and now we're launching new cart lines,

00:28.080 --> 00:34.280
targeted at the full supermarket segment. And for this trade show we're bringing carts

00:34.280 --> 00:42.400
for kids, carts for shopping with dogs, and a complete new lineup.

00:42.400 --> 00:47.760
So expectations are very high. The product is top quality, we have a solid client base,

00:47.760 --> 00:54.640
and we're here again looking to gain a larger share of the shopping cart market.

00:55.200 --> 00:58.200
Perfect — let's go. It's a pleasure to help you on this journey.

00:58.200 --> 00:58.700
Thank you.

00:58.700 --> 00:59.200
All good.
